## Purpose

Reduce Tool Shed's conceptual and implementation surface before making the 100k view a standard
feature. Preserve the mature authority, lifecycle, outcome, recovery, portability, and delivery
contracts while replacing duplicated project-world interpretation with one reusable projection.

## Desired Outcome

Tool Shed has an explicit capability/disposition inventory, measured reduction rules, and one
authority-aware project projection that produces both the concise executive state and exhaustive
lifecycle ledger. Existing dashboard behavior remains compatible, the seam is proven on Linux and
Windows at the exact Work2 candidate, and IDEA-0028 can consume the projection without adding a
second project model or duplicating current overview/status surfaces.

